<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA SET INDIA 467 TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA SET INDIA 467 TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa declared their second innings at 367 for three on the fourth day of the second test on Saturday, setting India a target of 467.</p>
</text>
